# Gate allowlist for bar 05 (`check | item | reason`). The README's "Light bake" section explains it.
lightmap-density | lightmap desk density | The remaining loss sits within 3 doubled px of where the strip and the lamp base stand on the desk (measured at 256 texels per m: 0.86 to 0.96 of the window loss^2 on about 2 % of the desk's texels). At such a hard contact edge the loss falls only as about density^-1/2 while the per-texel noise stays the same (loss over noise 1.53 at 256, 1.15 at 512), so passing needs about 1024 texels per m and a 50 to 60 MB bake. The kit cannot yet give finer texels to a contact band only.
